flowchart TD
    A["Ejemplo:<br/>∫ (x+5)/((x+2)(x−1)) dx"]
    S1["Descomposición:<br/>(x+5)/((x+2)(x−1)) = A/(x+2) + B/(x−1)"]
    S2["x + 5 = A(x − 1) + B(x + 2)"]
    C1["x = 1:  6 = 3B → B = 2"]
    C2["x = −2: 3 = −3A → A = −1"]
    I["∫ [−1/(x+2) + 2/(x−1)] dx"]
    R["= −ln|x+2| + 2·ln|x−1| + C"]
    RC["Forma compacta:<br/>ln | (x−1)² / (x+2) | + C"]
    OK["Verificar derivando:<br/>recupera (x+5)/((x+2)(x−1))"]
    A --> S1
    S1 --> S2
    S2 --> C1
    S2 --> C2
    C1 --> I
    C2 --> I
    I --> R
    R --> RC
    RC --> OK

